<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>LaporIn - Solusi Layanan Fasilitas Publik</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.1/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <style>
        :root { --primary: #2563eb; --bg: #ffffff; }
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: var(--bg); color: #1e293b; }
        
        .navbar { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
        
        .hero-section {
            padding: 100px 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fafc 0%, #eff6ff 100%);
            border-radius: 0 0 50px 50px;
        }

        .hero-title { font-weight: 800; font-size: 3.5rem; color: #0f172a; line-height: 1.2; }
        .text-blue { color: var(--primary); }

        .btn-start {
            padding: 15px 35px;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 12px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .feature-card {
            border: none;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: white;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            transition: 0.3s;
            height: 100%;
        }
        .feature-card:hover { transform: translateY(-10px); }
        .icon-box {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            background: #eff6ff;
            color: var(--primary);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="navbar sticky-top p-3">
    <div class="container">
        <a class="navbar-brand fw-bold text-primary fs-3" href="/">
            <i class="bi bi-megaphone-fill me-2"></i>LaporIn
        </a>
        <div class="d-flex gap-2">
            <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-primary btn-start shadow-sm">Mulai Lapor</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</nav>

<section class="hero-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <h1 class="hero-title mb-4">Wujudkan Kota yang <span class="text-blue">Lebih Baik</span> Bersama.</h1>
                <p class="lead text-muted mb-5">Laporkan kerusakan fasilitas publik, pantau proses perbaikannya, dan bantu kami menjaga kenyamanan lingkungan Anda dengan satu klik.</p>
                <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                    <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-primary btn-start shadow">Buat Laporan Sekarang</a>
                    <a href="/reports" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-start">Lihat Peta</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6 d-none d-lg-block text-center">
                <i class="bi bi-building-check text-primary" style="font-size: 250px; opacity: 0.8;"></i>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="container my-5 py-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <h2 class="fw-bold">Kenapa Memakai LaporIn?</h2>
        <p class="text-muted">Proses pelaporan fasilitas jadi lebih transparan dan efisien.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon-box"><i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill"></i></div>
                <h5 class="fw-bold">Berbasis Lokasi</h5>
                <p class="text-muted">Sistem otomatis mendeteksi lokasi koordinat fasilitas yang dilaporkan agar petugas mudah menemukan titiknya.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon-box"><i class="bi bi-clock-history"></i></div>
                <h5 class="fw-bold">Pantau Real-Time</h5>
                <p class="text-muted">Cek status laporan Anda secara berkala, mulai dari pengajuan hingga proses perbaikan selesai dilakukan.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon-box"><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i></div>
                <h5 class="fw-bold">Terverifikasi</h5>
                <p class="text-muted">Petugas akan mengunggah foto bukti hasil perbaikan langsung dari lapangan untuk menjamin laporan selesai.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<footer class="py-5 text-center border-top">
    <p class="text-muted mb-0">&copy; 2026 LaporIn Team. Dibuat untuk kenyamanan bersama.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>